Package: rjd3bridge
Type: Package
Title: Bridge Between 'RJDemetra' (V2) and 'rjd3' (V3)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Alain", "Quartier-la-Tente", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                 email = "alain.quartier@yahoo.fr",
                 comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7890-3857"))
  )
Description: Provides bidirectional tools to convert seasonal adjustment 
    models and specifications between 'RJDemetra' ('JDemetra+' v2) 
    and the 'rjd3' ecosystem ('JDemetra+' v3, packages 'rjd3x13' and 'rjd3tramoseats'). 
    Facilitates workflow migration and backward compatibility analysis.
Depends:
  R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
  rJava,
  RJDemetra (>= 0.2.7),
  rjd3toolkit(>= 3.3.0),
  rjd3x13 (>= 3.3.0),
  rjd3tramoseats (>= 3.3.0),
  rjd3jars (>= 0.0.5)
URL: https://github.com/AQLT/rjd3bridge, https://aqlt.github.io/rjd3bridge/
BugReports: https://github.com/AQLT/rjd3bridge/issues
SystemRequirements: Java (>= 17)
